description:
Implement a `useGeolocation` hook that calls `navigator.geolocation.getCurrentPosition` on mount and returns `{ coords, loading, error }`. `loading` is `true` until the API responds.

**Example:**
```tsx
const { coords, loading, error } = useGeolocation();
if (loading) return <Spinner />;
if (error) return <p>Location unavailable</p>;
return <Map lat={coords.latitude} lng={coords.longitude} />;
```

